// @test: check
// @level: L0
// @tier: 0
// @tags: derive, meta, diagnostics
// @timeout: 20000
// @expected-exit: 0
// @expected-stderr: was not applied
// @description: A derive with neither a generator nor a blanket still
//   warns.

// The control for `derive_covered_by_a_blanket_is_silent.vr`. Without
// it, a repair that simply stopped emitting W0507 would satisfy that
// spec completely — and the twelve derives that genuinely generate
// nothing would go quiet, which is the state W0507 exists to prevent.
//
// `Serialize` has no generator and no blanket in `core/`.

@derive(Serialize)
type S is { v: Int };

public fn main() -> Int { 0 }
